2026-08-08T08:38:34.3774603Z [36;1m# disabled take 70.8 s at -j2 and 43.1 s at -j4 -- 1.64x, at identical[0m
2026-08-08T08:38:34.3775051Z [36;1m# user time. Peak RSS per unity object is ~834 MB, so four in flight is[0m
